00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Lex Fridman: In that same way, there's a kind of difference between speculation and investing.

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Renamed: Yeah, speculation is just a bit like trading crypto, right? You're-

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Keyu Jin: Yeah, absolutely. Without that, how can you have this radical, dynamic entrepreneurialism you see in China? If you don't have a sense of self, a sense of the fact that you can find opportunities, you look for opportunities, you drive opportunities, it's all self-motivated.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Lex Fridman: Strong words.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Renamed: Well, short-term trading crypto. Maybe in the long run there's intrinsic value, but many investors in a bubble going into the crash were really just pure speculators. They didn't know what things were worth, they just knew they were going up. That's speculation.

9
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Lex Fridman: Is there still a young kid in China that's able to dream to

